---
name: Turn OpenSSH Syslog messages into OCSF
description: |
  Receives Syslog over TCP, selects OpenSSH daemon messages, normalizes them to
  OCSF, and publishes the events to the `ocsf` topic.
---

accept_tcp "0.0.0.0:6514" {
  read_syslog raw_message=raw
}
where app_name in ["sshd", "sshd-session", "sshd.pam", "sshd-session.pam"]
openssh::ocsf::normalize
publish "ocsf"
